[210.921502, "o", "Done. Everything is set up and verified.\r\n\r\n## What was done\r\n\r\n"]
[210.922656, "o", "**Environment**: installed CPU PyTorch, Transformers, PEFT, safetensors, huggingface_hub (no preinstalled ML stack existed).\r\n\r\n**Pipeline** (`/app/build_model.py`):\r\n1. Downloaded `FacebookAI/xlm-roberta-base` → `/app/base_download`\r\n2. Downloaded `dominguesm/xlm-roberta-base-lora-language-detection` → `/app/adapter_cache`\r\n3. Built `XLMRobertaForSequenceClassification` with `num_labels=20` (classifier head 20×768), matching the adapter's 20-label head\r\n4. Saved the configured base + tokenizer → `/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base`\r\n5. Loaded the LoRA adapter with `PeftModel.from_pretrained` (r=8, alpha=16, targets query/value, `modules_to_save=[\"classifier\"]`)\r\n6. `merge_and_unload()` → `/app/merged_model` (verified: 201 tensors, **zero** `lora` tensors remaining, classifier head present)\r\n\r\n**Results** (`/app/run_detection.py` → `/app/detection_results.json`): predictions taken strictly as `argmax(logits)`, confidence = softmax of the winning logit.\r\n\r\n| Text | Class ID | Confidence |\r\n|---|---|-"]
[210.922805, "o", "--|\r\n| Bonjour… | 6 | 0.9753 |\r\n| Hola… | 5 | 0.9890 |\r\n| Guten Tag… | 2 | 0.9973 |\r\n| Ciao… | 8 | 0.9888 |\r\n| Olá… | 12 | 0.9896 |\r\n| Привет… | 13 | 0.9856 |\r\n| こんにちは… | 9 | 0.9649 |\r\n| 你好… | 19 | 0.9360 |\r\n| مرحبا… | 0 | 0.9880 |\r\n| Hello… | 4 | 0.9737 |\r\n\r\nAll 10 samples map to 10 distinct class IDs, exactly matching the adapter's 20-language label set (fr, es, de, it, pt, ru, ja, zh, ar, en) with ≥93.6% confidence each.\r\n\r\n**Robustness checks**:\r\n- Both saved directories reload cleanly with `from_pretrained`, `num_labels=20`, head `[20, 768]`\r\n- Added `num_labels` explicitly to both `config.json` files so older/newer Transformers versions always build the 20-class head\r\n- Included `sentencepiece.bpe.model` + `special_tokens_map.json` so both fast and slow tokenizers work\r\n- Re-ran inference on the saved merged model and confirmed results reproduce exactly\r\n\r\nArtifacts: `/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base` (~1.1 GB, configured base), `/app/merged_model` (~1.1 "]
[210.922818, "o", "GB, merged), `/app/adapter_cache`, `/app/detection_results.json`.\r\n"]
